{
  "bookId": "rewind-52",
  "id": "chapter-215",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "42011001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "入夜，潮酷街区。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42011002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "那么就由我负责北面区域的检查，希塔，帕拉斯的资料加载完毕了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42011003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "已经完成，可以立刻开始对南面区域的搜查。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42011004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "嗯，其他人也已经前往爱猫社区了，有掌柜在，那边不需要太担心。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42011005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "菲伊小姐，剩余香水的回收——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42011006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "我来负责。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42011007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "不排除那位客人的植物也受到了香水影响，务必小心。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42011008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "这是临时联络器，保持联络。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42011009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "收到，完成任务后我会及时汇报。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42011010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "不是这么用的哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42011011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42011012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "如果需要帮助的话，可以随时联络。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42011013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "我……我会试着使用。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42011014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "众人按照计划分头行动，菲伊则在一边处理着花店中受到影响的植物，一边等待着贝歌的到来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42011015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "冲洗、通风处理完毕。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42011016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "空气中气味分子含量已重新回到安全范围内。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42011017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "塞壬小姐应该快到了，稍后需要向她说明香水的特殊作用。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42011018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小蘑菇",
          "text": "小菲~再给我们来点水吧，呜呜，身上都是烤肉味。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42011019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小蘑菇",
          "text": "感觉变成了油油蘑菇了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42011020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "没事，最终都让你变成了有香味的蘑菇，结果相同。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42011021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小蘑菇",
          "text": "不是这个香味，小菲完全不懂！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42011022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "时间在聊天中悄悄过去，但那位客人依旧没有到来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42011023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "……不排除因为混乱导致路线堵塞，再等待30分钟。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42011024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "30分钟后。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42011025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山茶花",
          "text": "喂，赶紧关门吧，我的花瓣可是很娇嫩的，夜风对我可不友好。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42011026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小蘑菇",
          "text": "可是……小菲不是在等人吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42011027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42011028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山茶花",
          "text": "你是笨蛋吗？！我当然知道在等人，转移话题啊，笨蛋蘑菇！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42011029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小蘑菇",
          "text": "呜呜被说了两遍笨蛋……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42011030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山茶花",
          "text": "人类总是很容易忘记约定的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42011031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "不，那位客人看起来很珍惜她的蒲公英。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42011032",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "应该是香水出问题了……我直接过去找。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42011033",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山茶花",
          "text": "喂！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42011034",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "店铺就拜托你们了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42011035",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "我会关上门，夜风就不会吹进来了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42011036",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山茶花",
          "text": "……哼，我才不是这个意思。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-1062",
