      "title": "人鱼酣梦中·Ⅲ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "42014001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "跟随线索，菲伊来到潮酷街区的另一侧。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42014002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "测算完成，根据不同种属植物的枯萎速度，判断香水挥发速度每小时都在加快。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42014003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "……很不合理，仅凭风力这一种媒介是无法达到现在的传播速度的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42014004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星洛",
          "text": "呜呜，我的烤肉……怎么这么难吃……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42014005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "星洛？怎么会在这里，店长不是让星洛在店里休息吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42014006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星洛",
          "text": "哇啊啊啊啊我根本不会烤肉！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42014007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "星洛，冷静店里出了什么事？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42014008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星洛",
          "text": "是菲伊，你是不是也觉得我的烤肉很难吃，根本没有人喜欢，我是个不合格的猎人。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42014009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "情绪不对劲，难道说……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42014010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "并没有，根据大家的反应来看，星洛的烤肉一直调味适中。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42014011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星洛",
          "text": "呜呜凛也是，菲伊也是，一直没有表情，肯定是觉得星洛做不好呜呜！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42014012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "……对不起，我没有这个——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42014013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星洛",
          "text": "我不管了，我以后都不要做烤肉了！！！反正肯定没有人喜欢我的烤肉呜呜……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42014014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "奇怪，星洛从来不会说这种丧气话……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42014015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "先联系附近的管理局手办。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42014016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "一段时间后。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42014017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "管理局工作人员在街区内的巡逻频率至少比平常增加了30%。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42014018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "闹事的手办在不断增加。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42014019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "酒井唯",
          "text": "锻炼真的有用吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42014020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "酒井唯",
          "text": "这群学员连每天一百组的训练都无法支撑下来，我要放弃了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42014021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42014022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "海柔尔",
          "text": "就让我一个人吧，我再也不想交朋友了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42014023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "海柔尔",
          "text": "孤独就是我的朋友……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42014024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42014025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "悲观影响已经扩散到手办了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-1065",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
