      "title": "人鱼酣梦中·Ⅳ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "42015001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "潮酷街区，角落。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42015002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "可恶可恶，怎么抓不到人陪我玩喵！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42015003",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "需要尽快绕路，这边的最短距离是——",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42015004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "喵~发现新的小伙伴，开始猫抓老鼠！今天要玩100局喵！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42015005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "我不是老鼠，所以不用参加。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42015006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "除了我以外，大家都是老鼠！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42015007",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "和之前的手办差不多，似乎神志都被影响了……",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42015008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "开始！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42016001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "在七拐八扭的巷子中一阵追逐后，菲伊在某个拐角停下。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42016002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "呼……呼……这下应该……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42016003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "喵喵，又找到新的伙伴了！你也一起来玩，我不会漏掉你的喵！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42016004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "看样子不知道哪里的手办吸引了她的注意。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42016005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "万幸。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42016006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "哎呀，实属万幸万幸啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42016007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "那位猫咪手办铁了心的要玩捉迷藏，差点束手无策啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42016008",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "菲伊闻声回头，只见暗巷深处还有一位藏身的「老鼠」。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42016009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "外面危机四伏，看您似乎已经奔波多时，不如暂且休息一下？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42016010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "不，我还有必须要做的事情。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42016011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "我得出去找人。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42016012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "唔，既然如此，那我送您一卦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42016013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "——遥寄东风。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42016014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "出去后，跟着风向走，或许会有帮助。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42016015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "……你是天气研究员？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42016016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "咳，也可以这么理解。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42016017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "多谢，我会尝试。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
